# Catering, Gently (data/missions.json catering; a deliver step with a vehicle and noBump 3): Hector's forty
# burritos in the taqueria's van, placed on Valencia by the mission, loaded at once (no pickup). Driven
# into the shop fronts on the east side at speed, the van bumps harder than 3 m/s: the burritos spill and
# the mission fails (bump), with Hector's line; its van goes.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 mission start catering 1
cmd 2 vehicle enter taqueria_van
bot drive -54,-250 -54,-238 -32,-242 -22,-244 from 10 speed 9 corner 9
run 1500
expect event missionStep{mission=catering,step=1,kind=deliver,seconds=200} within 1..1
expect event vehicleEnter{name=taqueria_van} within 2..3
expect event vanBump within 250..270
expect event missionFailed{mission=catering,step=1,reason=bump} within 250..270
expect no event missionDone
